Invoke a blast of cold all around you with a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)], doing [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Cold damage and freezing creatures to the ground for [6, 8, 10, 11, 12 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

Affected creatures can still act, but cannot move.

The duration will increase with your Spellpower.
